# Context

What a Claude Code session needs to know per domain

- [Agent](agent.md): The tool set, the system prompt, the model switch, and how hosted and local runs differ
- [Canvas](canvas.md): The map surface, its reducer, the layout modes, and how a tool call becomes a canvas action
- [CI](ci.md): Workflow triggers, the verify jobs, and the weekly snapshot refresh pull request
- [Deploy](deploy.md): Where the service and the client are hosted, the domain, and the hosting traps behind them
- [Development](development.md): The local loop, the scripts, the WSL2 limits, and the generate-then-check pattern
- [Evals](evals.md): The search comparison runner and the agent cases, kept as two separate stacks
- [Python](python.md): The FastAPI service, the search tools, and how the Typer CLI is laid out
- [Retrieval](retrieval.md): How survey notes are split, the encoder input rule, and the score cutoff
- [Web](web.md): How the Next.js client is laid out, its layers, and its conventions
